"G5178":{"id":"G5178","lemma":"τυμπανίζω","lang":"grc","translit":"tympanízō","pronunciation":"toom-pan-id'-zo","derivation":["from a derivative of ",{"ref":"G5180"}," (meaning a drum, \"tympanum\");"],"definition":["to stretch on an instrument of torture resembling a drum, and thus beat to death"],"usage":["torture."]},
"G5179":{"id":"G5179","lemma":"τύπος","lang":"grc","translit":"týpos","pronunciation":"too'-pos","derivation":["from ",{"ref":"G5180"},";"],"definition":["a die (as struck), i.e. (by implication) a stamp or scar; by analogy, a shape, i.e. a statue, (figuratively) style or resemblance; specially, a sampler (\"type\"), i.e. a model (for imitation) or instance (for warning)"],"usage":["en-(ex-)ample, fashion, figure, form, manner, pattern, print."]},
"G5180":{"id":"G5180","lemma":"τύπτω","lang":"grc","translit":"týptō","pronunciation":"toop'-to","derivation":["a primary verb (in a strengthened form);"],"definition":["to \"thump\", i.e. cudgel or pummel (properly, with a stick or bastinado), but in any case by repeated blows; thus differing from ",{"ref":"G3817"}," and ",{"ref":"G3960"},", which denote a (usually single) blow with the hand or any instrument, or ",{"ref":"G4141"}," with the fist (or a hammer), or ",{"ref":"G4474"}," with the palm; as well as from ",{"ref":"G5177"},", an accidental collision); by implication, to punish; figuratively, to offend (the conscience)"],"usage":["beat, smite, strike, wound."]},
